<title>POLAND: POLISH FOOD PRICES FLAT IN JULY 21-31.</title>
<headline>POLISH FOOD PRICES FLAT IN JULY 21-31.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices were flat in the July 21-31 period after falling 0.2 percent in the previous 10 days and were 1.1-percent lower than in the June 21-30 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
